### 2. Competitor Benchmarking & Fact-Checking

* **Supplied Competitor Benchmark:** [CaratLane Mangalsutra PLP](https://www.caratlane.com/jewellery/mangalsutra.html)
* **Identified Content & Technical Gaps:**
  1. *Metallurgical Durability:* Competitor pages display lightweight pieces without explaining the critical Vickers hardness difference (18K @ 130–160 HV vs 22K @ 50–70 HV) for daily chain link resilience and diamond prong tension.
  2. *Ergonomic Engineering:* Lack of guidance regarding 3g–8g daily weight thresholds, fixed centerpiece soldering to eliminate neck rotation, and 16" vs 18" collarbone nesting.
  3. *Safety Hardware:* Omission of spring-loaded lobster clasps versus pliable traditional S-hook fatigue failure.
* **Government & Statutory Fact-Checks Verified:**
  * **BIS Hallmarking & HUID:** Bureau of Indian Standards mandatory 3-part hallmark (triangular BIS logo, purity fineness `18K750` / `22K916`, and 6-digit alphanumeric HUID) verifiable via the official BIS Care App.
  * **CBIC GST Taxation:** Central Board of Indirect Taxes and Customs statutory 3% GST on precious metals and natural diamonds, plus 5% GST on craftsmanship/making charges with transparent itemized invoicing.

